{"fingerprint":"a146d058e37492f8ea38cae32975ac23a8b256a625bd23d0e6923bb4764c5f5e","path":"src/review_gauntlet/cli.py","rule_id":"test-evidence","content":"`_finding_states` constructs and executes raw SQL directly in the CLI layer, bypassing the `SessionStore` abstraction that all other database access uses. This couples the CLI to the DB schema and makes it harder to test or refactor the store independently.","suggestion_code":"","existing_code":"def _finding_states(
